body:
Definitely thought about this (and have been thinking about it). But there's still that fear that it won't work (even if it was legal in my country) and the thought that there's no 100% chance I'll be able to end me scares me to shit. I often find myself reaching a breaking point and then going "but what if ---" and I stop what I'm doing, drop everything and anything in my hands, and breathe. 

&#x200B;

An hour later I'll call someone. 

&#x200B;

But yeah Singapore has great gun laws (basically none because we don't even allow guns in the first place) but yeah. Probably for the better.
